    {
      "id": "claim_7ca1cd76fb00420fa792beb6a053fe28",
      "statement": "The Raindrop API token is bound from myfeeder.raindrop.api-token / MYFEEDER_RAINDROP_API_TOKEN as a config property, not stored in the database; it is read once into RaindropApiClientImpl's constructor rather than looked up per request.",
